    "CUDA multi-token padded row pitch must be a whole K-row multiple. General arbitrary strides remain unsupported.",
    "Vulkan non-dense shared inputs require native storage-buffer origin alignment at each bind; original dense inputs retain their alignment adapter. Native matrix occurrence dispatch is cold-bounded by actual initialized pipeline tiles and real device grid limits.",
    "Explicit singleton zero strides were executed on CPU Direct; CUDA executes multi-slot zero-stride View, while its same-shape singleton Graph View retains public original stride semantics.",
    "Apple NVFP4 kernel remains absent. Covered F32/Q8 domains do not establish every Metal codec or complete model artifact execution.",
    "Historic CPU reference helper corrections were source-reviewed; their large historical consumer suites were not run this batch.",
    "No new Linux execution, full model quality evaluation, throughput measurement or aggregate memory-peak acceptance.",
    "The current broad architecture goal remains active; this bounded batch does not complete model/quantization/fusion/platform coverage."
